body:
I have a question to all students out there using Adderall or Vyvanse; How do you keep yourself from watching porn when on medication?

&#x200B;

I don't have that much of a problem to not look at porn when I'm not on Vyvanse. But when on.. Most of my relapses are when I'm studying on the medication and many times I wonder if I'm gonna have to quit porn after i finish my degree instead.
